)\n+      - CLAUDE.md (project conventions)\n+\n+    files:\n+      - path: cmd/stat/main.go\n+        action: modify\n+        note: Implement format directive expansion and filesystem mode\n+\n+    requirements:\n+      - id: R1\n+        text: \"Implement srd082 R3.1: --file-system / -f mode that displays filesystem information (type, block size, blocks total/free/available, inode total/free) instead of file information, using the statfs syscall\"\n+      - id: R2\n+        text: \"Implement srd082 R4.1: format directive expansion for file attributes -- implement every file-mode directive specified in srd082-stat.yaml (e.g., %a access rights octal, %A access rights human, %b blocks, %d device, %f raw mode hex, %F file type, %g group id, %G group name, %h hard links, %i inode, %n name, %N quoted name, %o I/O block size, %s total size, %u user id, %U user name, %w/%W birth time, %x/%X access time, %y/%Y modify time, %z/%Z change time)\"\n+      - id: R3\n+        text: \"Implement srd082 R4.2: format directive expansion for filesystem attributes -- implement every filesystem-mode directive specified in srd082-stat.yaml (e.g., %a free blocks available, %b total blocks, %c total inodes, %d free inodes, %f filesystem id, %i filesystem id, %l max filename length, %n filename, %s block size, %S fundamental block size, %t/%T filesystem type hex/name)\"\n+      - id: R4\n+        text: \"Implement srd082 R5.1: --dereference / -L option that follows symbolic links and reports metadata of the target file instead of the symlink itself\"\n+\n+    design_decisions:\n+      - id: D1\n+        text: Use golang.org/x/sys/unix.Statfs for filesystem metadata in --file-system mode.\n+      - id: D2\n+        text: File format directives map directly to pkg/sys.FileInfo struct fields -- read srd082-stat.yaml R4.1 for the exact mapping of each directive letter to its data source.\n+      - id: D3\n+        text: When --dereference is set, use pkg/sys.Stat instead of pkg/sys.Lstat for 